{"id":1003,"date":"2023-09-26T20:53:40","date_gmt":"2023-09-27T03:53:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/?page_id=1003"},"modified":"2023-09-28T21:58:37","modified_gmt":"2023-09-29T04:58:37","slug":"export-project","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/features\/export-project\/","title":{"rendered":"Export Project"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-1003\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-1003-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1003-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h1>Exploring the Export Project Feature<\/h1>\n<p>Imagine the power to transform your entire game project into a professional, beautifully formatted PDF document with a simple click. This capability empowers game developers, both indie creators and seasoned studios, to present their projects in a visually stunning and easily shareable format easier than before.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1003-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1003-1\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-1003-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-1003-1-0\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Pitch Game in Cover Letter<\/h2>\n<p>Your project's vision is the heart and soul of your game. Front and center should be your overview for the game. The PDF Export includes a cover letter section where your project description can be used as a compelling game vision statement. This statement encapsulates the essence of your project, ensuring that every reader understands the passion and creativity driving your game development journey.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1003-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-1-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1003-1-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-1003\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/cover-letter.png\" width=\"766\" height=\"456\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/cover-letter.png 766w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/cover-letter-300x179.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 766px) 100vw, 766px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1003-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1003-2\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-1003-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-1003-2-0\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Game Elements<\/h2>\n<p>Game Elements are the building blocks of your game - characters, items, quests, levels, and more. The export will list all these elements comprehensively. You can even include some concept art to give readers a visual sense of your various game elements. Each element is tagged with their categories, making it easy to navigate and understand.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1003-2-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-2-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"4\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1003-2-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-1003\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/element-pdf.png\" width=\"734\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/element-pdf.png 734w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/element-pdf-300x188.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 734px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1003-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1003-3\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-1003-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-1003-3-0\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Categories<\/h2>\n<p>Creating a structured hierarchy is essential in game development. It lists all your custom categories along with their descriptions. This is useful as a reference for the included Game Elements, ensure your systems are crystal clear to your team and stakeholders.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-1003-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1003-3-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-f